{"html": "<dialog class=\"hl-dlg\" aria-labelledby=\"hl-dlg-h\" data-hl-dialog data-lenis-prevent hidden>\n<div class=\"hl-box\">\n<div class=\"hl-top\">\n<ol class=\"hl-bars\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><li data-hl-bar></li><li data-hl-bar></li><li data-hl-bar></li><li data-hl-bar></li><li data-hl-bar></li><li data-hl-bar></li><li data-hl-bar></li><li data-hl-bar></li></ol>\n<div class=\"hl-bar2\"><h2 class=\"hl-t\" id=\"hl-dlg-h\">하이라이트 <span class=\"tn\"><span data-hl-cur>1</span> / 8</span></h2>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"hl-x\" data-hl-close><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"/></svg><span class=\"vh\">닫기</span></button></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hl-stage\" data-hl-stage>\n<div class=\"hl-s\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"하이라이트\" aria-label=\"1 / 8\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-hl-slide hidden>\n<figure class=\"hl-ph\"><span class=\"hl-ph-box\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/media/3343243-480.avif 480w, /assets/media/3343243-940.avif 940w, /assets/media/3343243-1280.avif 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 448px, calc(100vw - 32px)\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/media/3343243-480.webp 480w, /assets/media/3343243-940.webp 940w, /assets/media/3343243-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 448px, calc(100vw - 32px)\"><img src=\"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms2/website/43/3343243.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" alt=\"수원 화성 사진 1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-kogl=\"1\"></picture></span><figcaption>수원 화성 · 출처: 한국관광공사 · 공공누리 제1유형</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"hl-q\"><blockquote lang=\"en\" cite=\"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/817/\"><p>Built between 1794 and 1796 by King Jeongjo, Hwaseong Fortress in Suwon combines Eastern and Western military architecture with four grand gates, bastions, and observation towers.</p></blockquote>\n<figcaption class=\"hl-meta\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">— </span><span class=\"ab-src\">UNESCO World Heritage Centre</span> · <span>영어</span> · <time datetime=\"2026-06-15\" class=\"tn\">2026년 6월 15일(월)</time></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"hl-act\"><a class=\"hl-go\" href=\"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/817/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-track=\"abroad_click\">원문 보기<svg class=\"icon icon-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5\"/></svg><span class=\"vh\"> (UNESCO World Heritage Centre, 새 탭)</span></a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hl-s\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"하이라이트\" aria-label=\"2 / 8\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-hl-slide hidden>\n<figure class=\"hl-ph\"><span class=\"hl-ph-box\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/media/3343248-480h.avif 480w, /assets/media/3343248-940h.avif 940w, /assets/media/3343248-1280h.avif 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 448px, calc(100vw - 32px)\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/media/3343248-480h.webp 480w, /assets/media/3343248-940h.webp 940w, /assets/media/3343248-1280h.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 448px, calc(100vw - 32px)\"><img src=\"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms2/website/48/3343248.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" alt=\"화성행궁 사진 1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-kogl=\"1\"></picture></span><figcaption>화성행궁 · 출처: 한국관광공사 · 공공누리 제1유형</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"hl-q\"><blockquote lang=\"en\" cite=\"https://english.visitkorea.or.kr/svc/whereToGo/locIntrdn/rgnContentsView.do?vcontsId=111120\"><p>As the largest temporary palace of the Joseon Dynasty, Hwaseong Haenggung and the lakeside pavilion Banghwasuryujeong bring royal court culture and moonlit strolls to life.</p></blockquote>\n<figcaption class=\"hl-meta\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">— </span><span class=\"ab-src\">VisitKorea (Korea Tourism Organization)</span> · <span>영어</span> · <time datetime=\"2026-05-18\" class=\"tn\">2026년 5월 18일(월)</time></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"hl-act\"><a class=\"hl-go\" href=\"https://english.visitkorea.or.kr/svc/whereToGo/locIntrdn/rgnContentsView.do?vcontsId=111120\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-track=\"abroad_click\">원문 보기<svg class=\"icon icon-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5\"/></svg><span class=\"vh\"> (VisitKorea (Korea Tourism Organization), 새 탭)</span></a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hl-s\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"하이라이트\" aria-label=\"3 / 8\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-hl-slide hidden>\n<figure class=\"hl-ph\"><span class=\"hl-ph-box\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/media/4121209-480.avif 480w, /assets/media/4121209-940.avif 940w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 448px, calc(100vw - 32px)\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/media/4121209-480.webp 480w, /assets/media/4121209-940.webp 940w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 448px, calc(100vw - 32px)\"><img src=\"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/09/4121209_image2_1.jpg\" width=\"940\" height=\"627\" alt=\"화서문(華西門)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-kogl=\"1\"></picture></span><figcaption>화서문(華西門) · 출처: 한국관광공사 · 공공누리 제1유형</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"hl-q\"><blockquote lang=\"en\" cite=\"https://www.koreaherald.com/article/3214890\"><p>Along Haengnidan-gil and Suwon Fried Chicken Street, rooftop cafes overlooking fortress walls stand steps away from decades-old cauldron fried chicken shops.</p></blockquote>\n<figcaption class=\"hl-meta\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">— </span><span class=\"ab-src\">The Korea Herald</span> · <span>영어</span> · <time datetime=\"2026-04-22\" class=\"tn\">2026년 4월 22일(수)</time></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"hl-act\"><a class=\"hl-go\" href=\"https://www.koreaherald.com/article/3214890\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-track=\"abroad_click\">원문 보기<svg class=\"icon icon-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5\"/></svg><span class=\"vh\"> (The Korea Herald, 새 탭)</span></a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hl-s\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"하이라이트\" aria-label=\"4 / 8\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-hl-slide hidden>\n<figure class=\"hl-ph\"><span class=\"hl-ph-box\"><img src=\"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/77/3546877_image2_1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/77/3546877_image3_1.jpg 300w, https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/77/3546877_image2_1.jpg 940w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 448px, calc(100vw - 32px)\" width=\"940\" height=\"705\" alt=\"별마당도서관 스타필드 수원점\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-kogl=\"1\"></span><figcaption>별마당도서관 스타필드 수원점 · 출처: 한국관광공사 · 공공누리 제1유형</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"hl-q\"><blockquote lang=\"en\" cite=\"https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/www/culture/2026/03/145_371205.html\"><p>Soaring four stories high, Starfield Suwon&#39;s Byulmadang Library and the glass conservatories of Ilwol Arboretum showcase Suwon&#39;s contemporary cultural energy.</p></blockquote>\n<figcaption class=\"hl-meta\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">— </span><span class=\"ab-src\">The Korea Times</span> · <span>영어</span> · <time datetime=\"2026-03-14\" class=\"tn\">2026년 3월 14일(토)</time></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"hl-act\"><a class=\"hl-go\" href=\"https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/www/culture/2026/03/145_371205.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-track=\"abroad_click\">원문 보기<svg class=\"icon icon-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5\"/></svg><span class=\"vh\"> (The Korea Times, 새 탭)</span></a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hl-s\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"하이라이트\" aria-label=\"5 / 8\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-hl-slide hidden>\n<figure class=\"hl-ph\"><span class=\"hl-ph-box\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/media/3343248-480h.avif 480w, /assets/media/3343248-940h.avif 940w, /assets/media/3343248-1280h.avif 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 448px, calc(100vw - 32px)\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/media/3343248-480h.webp 480w, /assets/media/3343248-940h.webp 940w, /assets/media/3343248-1280h.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 448px, calc(100vw - 32px)\"><img src=\"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms2/website/48/3343248.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" alt=\"화성행궁 사진 1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-kogl=\"1\"></picture></span><figcaption>화성행궁 · 출처: 한국관광공사 · 공공누리 제1유형</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"hl-q\"><blockquote lang=\"en\" cite=\"https://koreajoongangdaily.joins.com/news/2026-09-25/culture/koreanHeritage/Suwon-Hwaseong-Cultural-Festival-and-Media-Art-Show-illuminate-Joseon-fortress/2104512\"><p>Every autumn, Suwon Hwaseong Cultural Festival and the Media Art projection mapping turn Hwaseomun and Janganmun Gates into a luminous stage of Joseon history.</p></blockquote>\n<figcaption class=\"hl-meta\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">— </span><span class=\"ab-src\">Korea JoongAng Daily</span> · <span>영어</span> · <time datetime=\"2026-09-25\" class=\"tn\">2026년 9월 25일(금)</time></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"hl-act\"><a class=\"hl-go\" href=\"https://koreajoongangdaily.joins.com/news/2026-09-25/culture/koreanHeritage/Suwon-Hwaseong-Cultural-Festival-and-Media-Art-Show-illuminate-Joseon-fortress/2104512\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-track=\"abroad_click\">원문 보기<svg class=\"icon icon-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5\"/></svg><span class=\"vh\"> (Korea JoongAng Daily, 새 탭)</span></a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hl-s\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"하이라이트\" aria-label=\"6 / 8\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-hl-slide hidden>\n<figure class=\"hl-ph\"><span class=\"hl-ph-box\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/media/3343243-480.avif 480w, /assets/media/3343243-940.avif 940w, /assets/media/3343243-1280.avif 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 448px, calc(100vw - 32px)\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/media/3343243-480.webp 480w, /assets/media/3343243-940.webp 940w, /assets/media/3343243-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 448px, calc(100vw - 32px)\"><img src=\"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms2/website/43/3343243.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" alt=\"수원 화성 사진 1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-kogl=\"1\"></picture></span><figcaption>수원 화성 · 출처: 한국관광공사 · 공공누리 제1유형</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"hl-q\"><blockquote lang=\"ja\" cite=\"https://www.konest.com/contents/spot_hot_report_detail.html?id=1124\"><p>ソウルから電車で約30分の水原（スウォン）は、世界遺産・水原華城の城郭散策や行理団通りのおしゃれカフェ、名物の水原王カルビを楽しめる人気の日帰り旅行先です。</p></blockquote>\n<figcaption class=\"hl-meta\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">— </span><span class=\"ab-src\" lang=\"ja\">KONEST (コネスト)</span> · <span>일본어</span> · <time datetime=\"2026-07-08\" class=\"tn\">2026년 7월 8일(수)</time></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"hl-act\"><a class=\"hl-go\" href=\"https://www.konest.com/contents/spot_hot_report_detail.html?id=1124\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-track=\"abroad_click\">원문 보기<svg class=\"icon icon-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5\"/></svg><span class=\"vh\"> (KONEST (コネスト), 새 탭)</span></a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hl-s\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"하이라이트\" aria-label=\"7 / 8\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-hl-slide hidden>\n<figure class=\"hl-ph\"><span class=\"hl-ph-box\"><img src=\"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource_photo/57/3478557_image2_1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource_photo/57/3478557_image3_1.jpg 300w, https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource_photo/57/3478557_image2_1.jpg 940w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 448px, calc(100vw - 32px)\" width=\"940\" height=\"528\" alt=\"수원화성 성곽길 사진 2\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-kogl=\"1\"></span><figcaption>수원화성 성곽길 · 출처: 한국관광공사 · 공공누리 제1유형</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"hl-q\"><blockquote lang=\"en\" cite=\"https://thesoulofseoul.net/suwon-hwaseong-fortress-day-trip-guide/\"><p>From the 5.7-kilometer fortress ramparts and Guangdong-style Wolhwawon Garden to the glowing boardwalks of Gwanggyo Lake Park, Suwon rewards slow exploration.</p></blockquote>\n<figcaption class=\"hl-meta\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">— </span><span class=\"ab-src\">The Soul of Seoul</span> · <span>영어</span> · <time datetime=\"2026-05-11\" class=\"tn\">2026년 5월 11일(월)</time></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"hl-act\"><a class=\"hl-go\" href=\"https://thesoulofseoul.net/suwon-hwaseong-fortress-day-trip-guide/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-track=\"abroad_click\">원문 보기<svg class=\"icon icon-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5\"/></svg><span class=\"vh\"> (The Soul of Seoul, 새 탭)</span></a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hl-s\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"하이라이트\" aria-label=\"8 / 8\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-hl-slide hidden>\n<figure class=\"hl-ph\"><span class=\"hl-ph-box\"><img src=\"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/88/4056588_image2_1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/88/4056588_image3_1.jpg 300w, https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/88/4056588_image2_1.jpg 940w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 448px, calc(100vw - 32px)\" width=\"940\" height=\"705\" alt=\"해우재 사진 2\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-kogl=\"1\"></span><figcaption>해우재 · 출처: 한국관광공사 · 공공누리 제1유형</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"hl-q\"><blockquote lang=\"en\" cite=\"https://www.haewoojae.com/\"><p>Suwon pairs quirky civic museums like Haewoojae Toilet Culture Park with the National Agricultural Museum beside historic Seoho Reservoir.</p></blockquote>\n<figcaption class=\"hl-meta\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">— </span><span class=\"ab-src\">ICOMOS / World Toilet Association Archive</span> · <span>영어</span> · <time datetime=\"2026-02-19\" class=\"tn\">2026년 2월 19일(목)</time></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"hl-act\"><a class=\"hl-go\" href=\"https://www.haewoojae.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-track=\"abroad_click\">원문 보기<svg class=\"icon icon-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5\"/></svg><span class=\"vh\"> (ICOMOS / World Toilet Association Archive, 새 탭)</span></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hl-nav\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"hl-btn\" data-hl-dir=\"-1\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M14.5 6 8.5 12l6 6\"/></svg><span>이전</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"hl-btn\" data-hl-dir=\"1\"><span>다음</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"m9.5 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button></div>\n</div>\n</dialog>"}